Application Architecture

text
                 User / Browser
                       |
                       |
                 Host Port 8080
                       |
                       v
             +-------------------+
             | Frontend Container|
             |   React + Nginx   |
             |      Port 80      |
             +-------------------+
                       |
                       | /api/*
                       |
                       v
             +-------------------+
             | Backend Container |
             | Node.js + Express |
             |     Port 4000     |
             +-------------------+


Docker Compose creates a private application network.

The frontend container can communicate with the backend using the Docker Compose service name:

text
backend:4000

This means containers do not need to depend on changing container IP addresses.


